Upstream-bound: no
Subject: [PORT_HOST] battle mesh OT index uses OT_TYPE stride

FIGHTSTG_drawMesh indexes the layer OT as a u_long*. Under __psyz,
OT_TYPE is {addr, len} (two u_longs). HUD goes through getOtEntry
(patch 0017) and shows. Mesh prims were linked into the middle of an
entry, so DrawOTag never walked them. On PS1 OT_TYPE is u_long.

--- a/src/battle/battle_mode/model_mesh.c
+++ b/src/battle/battle_mode/model_mesh.c
@@ -785,7 +785,12 @@
             } else {
                 gte_AverageZ3(otz, z1, z2, &otz);
             }
-            state->ot = state->otBase + otz;
+#if PORT_HOST
+            /* OT_TYPE is two u_longs; otz is an entry index (see 0017). */
+            state->ot = state->otBase + otz * (s32)(sizeof(OT_TYPE) / sizeof(u_long));
+#else
+            state->ot = state->otBase + otz;
+#endif
             if (state->gouraud) {
                 FIGHTSTG_addMeshPolyGT(state);
             } else {
